Z||000000||GarethWright||10-28-2001||08:34 PM||||I assume that I need the High Temp paint, but will Powdercoating hold, do I need to do anything special to prep the metal once I get the current paint off?<BR>Thanks, <BR>Gareth||||reg||1
Z||000001||Fierozilla||10-28-2001||09:09 PM||||I cleaned and lightly sanded mine w/ a scotchbright pad. I then painted it w/BBQ black high heat paint. Available at any hardware store. Looks great too; not too dull and not too shiny.||||reg||1
